- `I2CDutPins` wraps the cocotb `dut` handle with `dut.<pin>` access for all 13 pins, plus `drive_transaction`/`drive_inputs` (width-masked writes), `sample_outputs`/`sample_into_item`, `scl/sda` released-level helpers, and reset convenience methods. Robust `0/1/x/z`→int coercion verified.
