- Full pin table (direction, width, exact `dut.<name>` access) for all inputs/outputs/inouts including open-drain `scl`/`sda`.
- Clock/reset semantics: rising-edge clock, active-low asynchronous `rst_n`, reset values, plus the documented RTL discrepancy (RTL memory not cleared on reset vs. reference model `reset()`).
